## 3.3.1 ArrayList的Remove方法

在ArrayList的Remove方法中，我们将测试Remove函数的contract。

```java
/// <summary>
///     Removes the first occurrence of the specified object from the ArrayList.
///     If the object is not found in the ArrayList, it remains unchanged.
/// </summary>
/// <returns>
///     <b>true</b> if the object was successfully removed;
///     <b>false</b> if the object was not found.
/// </returns>
public bool Remove(object value)
{
    int index = IndexOf(value);
    if (index != -1) {
        RemoveAt(index);
        return true;
    }
    return false;
}
```

Remove函数的contract有以下几点需要检查：
1. 如果指定的对象在ArrayList中存在，那么函数返回true并从ArrayList中删除对象，此时ArrayList的Count应该-1。
2. 如果指定的对象在ArrayList中不存在，那么函数返回false，ArrayList不应该改变。

对于这两点，我们可以编写如下测试：

```java
[Test]
public void TestRemove()
{
    // 1. Specify an object that exists in ArrayList and verify it is removed
    // Assuming ArrayList has [1, 2, 3]
    ArrayList list = new ArrayList(new int[]{1, 2, 3});
    bool result = list.Remove(2);
    Assert.IsTrue(result);
    Assert.AreEqual(2, list.Count); // expected: 2, actual: 2 

    // 2. Specify an object that does not exist in ArrayList and verify it is not removed
    result = list.Remove(10);
    Assert.IsFalse(result);
    Assert.AreEqual(2, list.Count); // expected: 2, actual: 2 
}
```

如果这两个测试都能pass，那么我们确认Remove函数是按照contract来实现的。如果存在其他异常，比如NullPointerException等，我们需要添加更多对应的测试来验证Remove函数的contract。-----

